From a85d24a4f58ccc32309d36a04631351da1c839e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:15:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review completion confirmation so terminal users
 close clean patch chats

When a review resolves without findings, the controller selects the reviewed patch chat and asks whether the feature is done. Terminal handling treats yes as a local close action and sends any other reply back to the patch agent so the user can continue the conversation.
